It is a fork of https://github.com/sescandell/gladys-zwavejs, modified by
William Deren: colour lights, door locks, sirens, garage doors, thermostat
fans, the "Z-Wave network" widget, scene triggers and actions, release
pipeline.

It talks to Z-Wave JS UI (https://github.com/zwave-js/zwave-js-ui, MIT
License) through an MQTT broker. The cover shows the Z-Wave JS logo
(https://github.com/zwave-js/zwave-js, MIT License), used only to name the
software this unofficial integration connects to.

The test fixtures colorBulbNode, doorLockNode, sirenNode, garageDoorNode and
fanThermostatNode are converted from the zwave_js test fixtures of Home
Assistant (https://github.com/home-assistant/core, Apache License 2.0).
